      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Introduction to the 11P Male Pin Header Connector 
    &lt;div id=&#34;introduction-to-the-11p-male-pin-header-connector&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
